        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the nebula. Power up your thrusters. Become the last line of defense.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nebula Invaders</strong> is a 2D arcade action game where every move, every shot, and every explosion matters. Pilot a fast and responsive spaceship through a minimalist starfield and take on waves of colorful enemies, each with unique shapes and attack patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy invaders to collect bonuses, upgrade your weapons, and challenge powerful bosses whose defeat will grant you even greater ship enhancements. No story, no mercy—just you, your reflexes, and a dazzling neon storm in the endless void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌠 Fast-paced, fluid arcade gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚙️ Ship and weapon upgrade system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👾 Intense boss battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💫 Neon aesthetic inspired by TRON and classic arcade shooters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹️ Progressive difficulty for an ever-growing challenge</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re a nostalgic fan of retro shooters or simply looking for a thrilling, hypnotic action experience, <strong>Nebula Invaders</strong> will pull you into a cosmic dance of light and destruction where precision is survival.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the nebula. Power up your thrusters. Become the last line of defense.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nebula Invaders</strong> is a 2D arcade action game where every move, every shot, and every explosion matters. Pilot a fast and responsive spaceship through a minimalist starfield and take on waves of colorful enemies, each with unique shapes and attack patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy invaders to collect bonuses, upgrade your weapons, and challenge powerful bosses whose defeat will grant you even greater ship enhancements. No story, no mercy—just you, your reflexes, and a dazzling neon storm in the endless void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌠 Fast-paced, fluid arcade gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚙️ Ship and weapon upgrade system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👾 Intense boss battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💫 Neon aesthetic inspired by TRON and classic arcade shooters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹️ Progressive difficulty for an ever-growing challenge</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re a nostalgic fan of retro shooters or simply looking for a thrilling, hypnotic action experience, <strong>Nebula Invaders</strong> will pull you into a cosmic dance of light and destruction where precision is survival.</p>",
        "short_description": "Nebula Invaders is a retro-neon space shooter where you pilot a lone ship against endless waves of interstellar invaders. Destroy, dodge, upgrade your weapons, and survive in a vibrant cosmic battlefield!",
